 "La derivada: la velocidad del cambio": "The derivative: the speed of change",
 "MATEMÁTICAS · 1.º DE BACHILLERATO": "MATH · 11TH GRADE (1.º BACHILLERATO)",
 "Derivar es<br>medir el cambio": "To differentiate is<br>to measure change",
 "Cuánto cambia algo en un instante: la idea que está detrás de la velocidad.": "How much something changes in an instant: the idea behind speed.",
 "Una curva": "A curve",
 "El velocímetro es un derivador: indica la rapidez en este instante, no la media del viaje.": "The speedometer is a differentiator: it shows the speed at this instant, not the average of the trip.",
 "La idea": "The idea",
 "<b style=\"font-size:26px;color:#7347d1\">Cambio medio</b><br><span style=\"font-size:21px;color:#251a3d\">Cuánto cambia algo en un intervalo.</span>": "<b style=\"font-size:26px;color:#7347d1\">Average change</b><br><span style=\"font-size:21px;color:#251a3d\">How much something changes over an interval.</span>",
 "<b style=\"font-size:26px;color:#ce7629\">Cambio instantáneo</b><br><span style=\"font-size:21px;color:#251a3d\">Cuánto cambia justo ahora.</span>": "<b style=\"font-size:26px;color:#ce7629\">Instantaneous change</b><br><span style=\"font-size:21px;color:#251a3d\">How much it changes right now.</span>",
 "<b style=\"font-size:26px;color:#2f9a78\">La derivada</b><br><span style=\"font-size:21px;color:#251a3d\">Es ese cambio instantáneo en cada punto.</span>": "<b style=\"font-size:26px;color:#2f9a78\">The derivative</b><br><span style=\"font-size:21px;color:#251a3d\">It is that instantaneous change at every point.</span>",
 "Pedid ejemplos en los que la velocidad media oculta lo que ocurrió.": "Ask for examples where average speed hides what happened.",
 "Velocidad media": "Average speed",
 "<div style=\"font-size:62px;font-weight:800;color:#7347d1;line-height:1.05\">150 km</div><div style=\"font-size:23px;color:#251a3d\">recorridos</div>": "<div style=\"font-size:62px;font-weight:800;color:#7347d1;line-height:1.05\">150 km</div><div style=\"font-size:23px;color:#251a3d\">traveled</div>",
 "<div style=\"font-size:62px;font-weight:800;color:#ce7629;line-height:1.05\">2 h</div><div style=\"font-size:23px;color:#251a3d\">de viaje</div>": "<div style=\"font-size:62px;font-weight:800;color:#ce7629;line-height:1.05\">2 h</div><div style=\"font-size:23px;color:#251a3d\">of travel</div>",
 "<div style=\"font-size:62px;font-weight:800;color:#2f9a78;line-height:1.05\">75 km/h</div><div style=\"font-size:23px;color:#251a3d\">velocidad media</div>": "<div style=\"font-size:62px;font-weight:800;color:#2f9a78;line-height:1.05\">75 km/h</div><div style=\"font-size:23px;color:#251a3d\">average speed</div>",
 "La velocidad media es el espacio dividido por el tiempo. No dice cuánto ibas en cada momento.": "Average speed is distance divided by time. It does not tell you how fast you were going at each moment.",
 "Un software de geometría dinámica permite ver la tangente moviéndose por la curva.": "Dynamic geometry software lets you see the tangent moving along the curve.",
 "La pendiente de una curva": "The slope of a curve",
 "<ul><li>En una recta, la pendiente es constante</li><li>En una curva, cambia en cada punto</li><li>La derivada es la pendiente de la recta tangente</li><li>Pendiente positiva: la función crece</li></ul>": "<ul><li>On a line, the slope is constant</li><li>On a curve, it changes at every point</li><li>The derivative is the slope of the tangent line</li><li>Positive slope: the function increases</li></ul>",
 "El apóstrofo (f′) se lee «f prima». Practicad una por una.": "The prime mark (f′) is read \"f prime.\" Practice them one by one.",
